Title:          ogg123.tcz
Description:    CLI ogg or opus player
Version:        1.4.3
Author:         see doc TCE/AUTHORS
Original-site:  https://ftp.osuosl.org/pub/xiph/releases/vorbis
Copying-policy: GPL v 2
Size:           40K
Extension_by:   aus9 @linuxquestions.org
Tags:           audio player ogg opus
Comments:       Play *.oga *.ogg *.ogv files
                but ogv means you will lack the video and
                just get the audio stream

                Play *.opus but you need to follow the info for libao
                and config ~/.libao to either default_driver=alsa or
                default_driver=pulse

                Split from vorbis-tools. 
                Optional TCE for locales=vorbis-tools-locale
                man page in vorbis-tools-doc TCE

Change-log:     2025/01/12 v 1.4.2 on 15x
                2025/12/17 v 1.4.3 on 16x 
Current:        2026/10/02 rebuilt against updated libao + opus support on 17x  
